  "remarks": "JSC ORBITA specialises in manufacture of electrical and optical equipment. It supplies electronic components to JSC IEMZ Kupol. It specifically supplies components used in the production of warheads of the Garpiya-A1 one-way attack UAVs. These UAVs are used by the Russian Armed Forces during Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine.",
